#: core/manager.cpp:299
msgid "Current Activity, Threaded"
msgstr "Trenutna aktivnost u nitima"

#: core/manager.cpp:300
msgid ""
"This view uses smart date range groups. Messages are threaded. So for "
"example, in \"Today\" you will find all the messages arrived today and all "
"the threads that have been active today."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj pregled koristi pametno uslovljavanje grupa po datumu. Poruke su "
"podijeljene u niti. Na primjer, u \"danas\" možete pronaći poruke koje su "
"stigle danas i sve niti koje su aktivne danas."

#: core/manager.cpp:317
msgid "Current Activity, Flat"
msgstr "Trenutna aktivnost, ravno"

#: core/manager.cpp:318
msgid ""
"This view uses smart date range groups. Messages are not threaded. So for "
"example, in \"Today\" you will simply find all the messages arrived today."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj prikaz koristi pametne grupe razdoblja. Poruke nisu u nitima. Tako na "
"primjer, u \"Danas\", jednostavno ćete naći sve poruke stigle danas."

#: core/manager.cpp:334
msgid "Activity by Date, Threaded"
msgstr "Aktivnost po datumu, podijeljeno u niti"

#: core/manager.cpp:335
msgid ""
"This view uses day-by-day groups. Messages are threaded. So for example, in "
"\"Today\" you will find all the messages arrived today and all the threads "
"that have been active today."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj pregled koristi grupe uslovljene od dana do dana. Poruke su podijeljene "
"u niti. Na primjer, u \"danas\" ćete pronaci poruke koje su stigle danas i "
"sve niti koje su bile aktivne danas."

#: core/manager.cpp:352
msgid "Activity by Date, Flat"
msgstr "Aktivnost po datumu, ravno"

#: core/manager.cpp:353
msgid ""
"This view uses day-by-day groups. Messages are not threaded. So for example, "
"in \"Today\" you will simply find all the messages arrived today."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj pregled koristi grupe uslovljene od dana do dana. Poruke nisu podiljene "
"u niti. Tako da ćete u \"danas\" jednostavno pronaci poruke koje su "
"pristigle danas."

#: core/manager.cpp:369
msgid "Standard Mailing List"
msgstr "Standardna mailing lista"

#: core/manager.cpp:370
msgid ""
"This is a plain and old mailing list view: no groups and heavy threading."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je jednostavi i zastarjeli prikaz mailing liste: nema grupa i povećano "
"djeljene u niti."

#: core/manager.cpp:383
msgid "Flat Date View"
msgstr "Ravni pregled datuma"

#: core/manager.cpp:384
msgid ""
"This is a plain and old list of messages sorted by date: no groups and no "
"threading."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je jednostavi i zastarjeli pregled poruka sortiranih po datumu: nema "
"grupisanja niti podjele u niti."

#: core/manager.cpp:399
msgid "Senders/Receivers, Flat"
msgstr "Pošaljioci/Primaoci, ravno"

#: core/manager.cpp:400
msgid ""
"This view groups the messages by senders or receivers (depending on the "
"folder type). Messages are not threaded."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj pregled grupiše poruke po uslovu pošaljioc ili primaoc (u zavisnosti od "
"tipa datoteke). Poruke nisu podiljene u niti."

#: core/manager.cpp:416
msgid "Thread Starters"
msgstr "Pokretač niti"

#: core/manager.cpp:417
msgid ""
"This view groups the messages in threads and then groups the threads by the "
"starting user."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj pregled grupiše poruke po nitima, a onda to grupiše po korisnicima koji "
"su ih počeli."

